  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Habesha Social Club is a space located in Aguascalientes&apos; historic neighbourhood La Estaci&#xF3;n. Its purpose is to become a collaborative, safe space for university students of refugee background and local peers to come together to celebrate interculturality. By building a bridge, sharing cultural diversity and organising awareness events, the students promote a sustainable integration and social inclusion of eople in the context of mobility.</narrative>
